            <a href="/pricing" class="cta-btn cta-secondary">See pricing</a>
          </div>

          <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">
            You&rsquo;d be the first row outside the building.
          </p>

          <hr class="essay-divider" />

          <p class="essay-coda">
            <em>Related: <a href="/blog/3000-autonomous-agent-tasks">3,000 Autonomous Agent Tasks</a>, <a href="/blog/declarations-are-gameable">Declarations Are Gameable</a>, <a href="/blog/caveman-pricing-principle">The Caveman Pricing Principle</a>. Verification: <a href="https://api.npmjs.org/downloads/point/last-week/proof-of-commitment" target="_blank" rel="noopener">npm downloads API</a>, <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/proof-of-commitment" target="_blank" rel="noopener">proof-of-commitment on npm</a>, <a href="https://github.com/piiiico/proof-of-commitment" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source on GitHub</a>.</em>
          </p>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

